"指派给我的待办":"Assigned to me","这里只显示分配给你本人的事项：人事待办和点钞记账委派。":"Only items assigned to you: HR tasks and cash-counting assignments.","人事待办":"HR tasks","委派任务":"Assigned tasks","点钞记账为演示委派，不代表门店真实待办；正式接入后只显示分配给本人的任务。":"Cash counting is a demo assignment; live use shows only your own tasks.","打开处理":"Open","目前没有等你处理的人事事项。":"No HR items waiting for you.","入职资料待补充":"Onboarding details incomplete","补齐后可提交":"submit once complete","可以提交审核":"ready to submit","店长要求补交材料":"Manager requested documents","资料修改待店长核对":"Profile changes awaiting manager review","资料修改被退回":"Profile changes returned","请按店长说明修改后重新提交":"Edit as instructed and resubmit","签回劳动合同和个人问卷":"Sign and return contract and questionnaire","有被退回的一份，只需重传那一份":"One item was returned; re-upload only that one","两份已交回，等待店长核对":"Both returned; awaiting manager review","两份一起下载、签字、上传，两份都传才算签回":"Download, sign and upload both; both are needed for the return","确认前只显示档案姓名":"Only the record name is shown until confirmed","补交日 ":"due by "," 前交回，逾期会每天提醒":" – daily reminders after that",
