"仅跳过演示步骤，未填写的资料仍保留为待补充。":"Skips the demo step only; missing details stay incomplete.","本机演示":"Local demo","本机仅演示账号激活步骤，不保存密码，不创建真实登录凭证。":"Local demo of activation only; no password is saved and no real credentials are created.","演示可不填密码，直接点击继续。":"In the demo you can continue without a password.","密码":"Password","确认密码":"Confirm password","设置密码并继续":"Set password and continue","激活员工账号":"Activate employee account","设置登录密码":"Set your login password","暂时无法识别这份邀请":"This invitation cannot be recognized","请联系店长重新提供入职链接。":"Please ask your manager for a new onboarding link.","邀请中的员工资料":"Employee details from the invitation","继续":"Continue","跳过注册过程，直接进入操作界面":"Skip onboarding and open the workspace","重新体验注册":"Restart onboarding","员工端 UI":"Employee portal","{done} / {total} 项已完成，缺项不能提交":"{done} / {total} items complete; missing items block submission","{done} / {total} 项已完成，可申请暂缺":"{done} / {total} items complete; missing ones can be approved","第一层还缺 {n} 项，补齐后可提交":"Layer 1 still missing {n} items — submit once complete","（演示用，正式版没有）":" (demo only, not in the live version)"
